{"surah":85,"ayahs":["وَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span>سَّ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_obligatory\">مَآ</span>ءِ ذَاتِ <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْبُ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_permissible\">رُو</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-qalaqah\">جِ</span>","وَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْيَوْمِ <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْمَوْ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_permissible\">عُو</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-qalaqah\">دِ</span>","وَشَاهِ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-idgham_ghunnah\">دٍ وَ</span>مَشْ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_permissible\">هُو</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-qalaqah\">دٍ</span>","قُتِلَ أَصْ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">حَٰ</span>بُ <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْأُخْ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_permissible\">دُو</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-qalaqah\">دِ</span>","ٱ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ghunnah\">نَّ</span>ارِ ذَاتِ <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْوَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_permissible\">قُو</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-qalaqah\">دِ</span>","إِذْ هُمْ عَلَيْهَا قُ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_permissible\">عُو</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-qalaqah\">دٌ</span>","وَهُمْ عَلَىٰ مَا يَفْعَلُونَ بِ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْمُؤْمِنِينَ شُ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_permissible\">هُو</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-qalaqah\">دٌ</span>","وَمَا نَقَمُو<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-slnt\">اْ</span> مِنْهُمْ إِ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_obligatory\">لَّآ</span> <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-idgham_ghunnah\">أَن يُ</span>ؤْمِنُو<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-slnt\">اْ</span> بِ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>للَّهِ <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْعَزِيزِ <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْحَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_permissible\">مِي</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-qalaqah\">دِ</span>","ٱلَّذِى لَهُ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">ۥ</span> مُلْكُ <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span>سَّ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">مَٰوَٰ</span>تِ وَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْأَرْضِ‌ۚ وَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>للَّهُ عَلَىٰ كُلِّ <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ikhafa\">شَىْءٍ شَ</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_permissible\">هِي</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-qalaqah\">دٌ</span>","إِ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ghunnah\">نَّ</span> <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لَّذِينَ فَتَنُو<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-slnt\">اْ</span> <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْمُؤْمِنِينَ وَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْمُؤْمِ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">نَٰ</span>تِ ثُ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ghunnah\">مَّ</span> لَمْ يَتُوبُو<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-slnt\">اْ</span> فَلَهُمْ عَذَابُ جَهَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ghunnah\">نَّ</span>مَ وَلَهُمْ عَذَابُ <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْحَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_permissible\">رِي</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-qalaqah\">قِ</span>","إِ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ghunnah\">نَّ</span> <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لَّذِينَ ءَامَنُو<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-slnt\">اْ</span> وَعَمِلُو<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-slnt\">اْ</span> <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">صَّٰ</span>لِ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">حَٰ</span>تِ لَهُمْ جَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">نَّٰ</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ikhafa\">تٌ تَ</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-qalaqah\">جْ</span>رِى مِ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ikhafa\">ن تَ</span>حْتِهَا <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْأَنْ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">هَٰ</span>رُ‌ۚ <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">ذَٰ</span>لِكَ <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْفَوْزُ <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْكَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_permissible\">بِي</span>رُ","إِ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ghunnah\">نَّ</span> بَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-qalaqah\">طْ</span>شَ رَبِّكَ لَشَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_permissible\">دِي</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-qalaqah\">دٌ</span>","إِ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ghunnah\">نَّ</span>هُ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">ۥ</span> هُوَ يُ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-qalaqah\">بْ</span>دِئُ وَيُ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_permissible\">عِي</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-qalaqah\">دُ</span>","وَهُوَ <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْغَفُورُ <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْوَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_permissible\">دُو</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-qalaqah\">دُ</span>","ذُو <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْعَرْشِ <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْمَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_permissible\">جِي</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-qalaqah\">دُ</span>","فَعَّا<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-idgham_wo_ghunnah\">لٌ لِّ</span>مَا يُ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_permissible\">رِي</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-qalaqah\">دُ</span>","هَلْ أَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">تَٰ</span>كَ حَدِيثُ <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْجُ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_permissible\">نُو</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-qalaqah\">دِ</span>","فِرْعَوْنَ وَثَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_permissible\">مُو</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-qalaqah\">دَ</span>","بَلِ <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لَّذِينَ كَفَرُو<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-slnt\">اْ</span> فِى تَكْ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_permissible\">ذِي</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-qalaqah\">بٍ</span>","وَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>للَّهُ <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-idgham_ghunnah\">مِن وَ</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_obligatory\">رَآ</span>ئِ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-idgham_shafawi\">هِم مُّ</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_permissible\">حِي</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-qalaqah\">طُۢ</span>","بَلْ هُوَ قُرْءَا<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-idgham_ghunnah\">نٌ مَّ</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_permissible\">جِي</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-qalaqah\">دٌ</span>","فِى لَوْ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-idgham_ghunnah\">حٍ مَّ</span>حْ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_permissible\">فُو</span>ظِۭ"]}